<topic>政和縣志</topic><geo_level1>政和</geo_level1><year_for_grouping>1597</year_for_grouping><author>鄒希賢</author><docclass>熈寧橋記</docclass><compilation_name>Fujian Bridge Sample</compilation_name><doc_content><Paragraph><Comment><CommentItem Category="default">陳脩, a 政德 local, donated 200金 in 嘉靖乙卯 (公元1555年:明世宗) for the construction of a wooden bridge. (See 政和縣志 71712, 明萬曆, p. 77)</CommentItem></Comment><span>萬曆_政和縣志_卷之八_詞翰誌_鄒希賢_熈寧橋記</span><br/><Date RefId="公元1555年:明世宗" Term="公元1555年:明世宗">嘉靖乙卯</Date><br/><Udef_work TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;work&quot;}">熈寧橋記</Udef_work>	<Office Type="officialTitle" RefId="markus_bureau_director" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;officialTitle&quot;}">郎中</Office><PersonName CbdbId="cbdb_207492" Term="cbdb_207492" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;fullname&quot;}">鄒希賢</PersonName><br/>郡之東百四十里許有邑曰<LocName RefId="hvd_40253" Term="hvd_40253">政和</LocName>其地西北接壤<LocName RefId="hvd_112063" Term="hvd_112063">浙</LocName>東東南抵<LocName RefId="hvd_32110" Term="hvd_32110">福寧</LocName>海嶠迤北則東<LocName RefId="hvd_112063" Term="hvd_112063">甌</LocName>諸郡?盖絡繹羽檄交馳而山巒聳峻川流瀠廻盖郡東一巨麗云邑治距西二十里古有<LocName>倪屯官壩</LocName>渡地勢<Udef_action_cause RefId="markus_marsh" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;action_cause&quot;}" Term="markus_marsh">湫</Udef_action_cause>隘春則<Udef_action_cause RefId="markus_flood" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;action_cause&quot;}" Term="markus_flood">暴漲</Udef_action_cause>茫茫<Udef_action_cause RefId="markus_hardship" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;action_cause&quot;}" Term="markus_hardship">難涉</Udef_action_cause>冬即涸沍然氷冽龜人趾足<Date RefId="公元1522年~1566年:明世宗" Term="公元1522年~1566年:明世宗">嘉靖</Date>間有<Udef_soccat RefId="markus_people" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;soccat&quot;}" Term="markus_people">民</Udef_soccat><PersonName CbdbId="cbdb_陳脩,fl1555,r政和" Term="cbdb_陳脩,fl1555,r政和" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;fullname&quot;}">陳脩</PersonName>者<Udef_labor_cost_origin 