us_raise">興</Udef_action>試觀今日<Udef_soccat RefId="markus_traveler" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;soccat&quot;}" Term="markus_traveler">行者</Udef_soccat><Udef_soccat RefId="markus_porter" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;soccat&quot;}" Term="markus_porter">負者</Udef_soccat><Udef_soccat RefId="markus_firewood_collector" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;soccat&quot;}" Term="markus_firewood_collector">樵採者</Udef_soccat><Udef_soccat RefId="markus_peasant" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;soccat&quot;}" Term="markus_peasant">耕</Udef_soccat>與<Udef_soccat RefId="markus_herdsman" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;soccat&quot;}" Term="markus_herdsman">牧者</Udef_soccat><Udef_soccat RefId="markus_tourist" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;soccat&quot;}" Term="markus_tourist">嬉逰而盤桓者</Udef_soccat>徃來于斯前者唱後者和悉<Udef_obj_meaning RefId="markus_rest" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;obj_meaning&quot;}" Term="markus_rest">憇</Udef_obj_meaning>于橋此之景象即擊壤鼓腹之世何以多讓儻所云<Udef_obj_meaning RefId="markus_peace" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;obj_meaning&quot;}" Term="markus_peace">雍熈寧謐</Udef_obj_meaning>者非邪此橋所為名也頋<Office Type="officialTitle" RefId="markus_magistrate" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;officialTitle&quot;}">侯</Office>之志有進于此者方今㝢内多虞東北厪憂<Office Type="officialTitle" RefId="markus_magistrate" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;officialTitle&quot;}">侯</Office>曩與余聚首<LocName RefId="hvd_112064" Term="hvd_112064">都門</LocName>激昂譚當世務纚纚不倦<Office Type="officialTitle" RefId="markus_magistrate" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;officialTitle&quot;}">侯</Office>政成矣録<Office Type="officialTitle" RefId="markus_magistrate" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;officialTitle&quot;}">侯</Office>績者將令<Office Type="officialTitle" RefId="markus_magistrate" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;officialTitle&quot;}">侯</Office>究其施則<Udef_obj_meaning RefId="markus_peace" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;obj_meaning&quot;}" Term="markus_peace">雍熈寧謐</Udef_obj_meaning>詎獨一政邑而所建竪又詎止于一橋哉廟堂疆塲湏之矣<Office Type="officialTitle" RefId="markus_magistrate" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;officialTitle&quot;}">侯</Office>名<PersonName CbdbId="cbdb_車鳴時,fl1597,o永福" Term="cbdb_車鳴時,fl1597,o永福" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;fullname&quot;}">鳴時</PersonName>别號<PersonName CbdbId="cbdb_車鳴時,fl1597,o永福" Term="cbdb_車鳴時,fl1597,o永福" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;fullname&quot;}">中吾</PersonName><LocName RefId="hvd_30165" Term="hvd_30165">粤</LocName>之<LocName RefId="hvd_42168" Term="hvd_42168">歸善</LocName>人襄理指畫<Udef_soccat RefId="markus_overseer" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;soccat&quot;}" Term="markus_overseer">董督</Udef_soccat>諸<Udef_soccat RefId="markus_corvee_laborer" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;soccat&quot;}" Term="markus_corvee_laborer">役</Udef_soccat>則<Office Type="officialTitle" RefId="markus_district_jailor" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;officialTitle&quot;}">邑尉</Office><LocName RefId="hvd_40570" Term="hvd_40570">丹徒</LocName><PersonName CbdbId="cbdb_吕應鍾,fl1595,o政和" Term="cbdb_吕應鍾,fl1595,o政和" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;fullname&quot;}">吕君應鍾</PersonName>與有<Udef_labor_cost_origin RefId="markus_disturb" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;labor_cost_origin&quot;}" Term="markus_disturb">勞</Udef_labor_cost_origin>焉署邑諭事則<LocName RefId="hvd_30033" Term="hvd_30033">金陵</LocName><PersonName CbdbId="cbdb_趙端,fl1595,o政和" Term="cbdb_趙端,fl1595,o政和" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;fullname&quot;}">趙君端</PersonName>以遷秩行而今<Office Type="officialTitle" RefId="markus_instructor" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;officialTitle&quot;}">諭</Office><LocName RefId="hvd_41095" Term="hvd_41095">南昌</LocName><PersonName CbdbId="cbdb_562708" Term="cbdb_562708" TagForConversion="{&quot;markus&quot;:&quot;fullname&quot;}">趙君國華</PersonName><Office Type="officialTitle" RefId